U.S. Geological Survey, National Minerals Information Center. Mineral Commodity Summaries 2026. [Official publication](https://www.usgs.gov/publications/mineral-commodity-summaries-2026) · [Silicon statistics and information](https://www.usgs.gov/centers/national-minerals-information-center/silicon-statistics-and-information).

Read the report's definitions and selected silicon, industrial-sand/quartz, metal, and industrial-feedstock sections needed by a study. Distinguish contained-element mass, ore/concentrate, compound, alloy, refined product, and annual flow. A commodity summary describes a dated supply/use account; it is not a complete process manual or a semiconductor-grade specification.

The official publication and indexed 2026 report were available during checking; the attempted individual silicon PDF endpoint returned an automated-access denial. Use the official publication/commodity links and record the actual edition and reporting-year definitions. Preserve USGS and separately credited material notices when reusing. Bibliographic identity and official source locations checked on 29 October 2026. No report, spreadsheet, or external dataset is copied here.

